<title>UK: RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND BEAT ARGENTINA 20-18. [corrected 14:25 gmt 15/12]</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-ENGLAND BEAT ARGENTINA 20-18. [corrected 14:25 gmt 15/12]</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Corrects try scorer from Mark Regan to Jason Leonard.)</p>
<p>England beat Argentina 20-18 (halftime 9-9) in their international at Twickenham on Saturday:</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>England - Try: Jason Leonard. Penalties: Mike Catt (5).</p>
<p>Argentina - Penalties: Gonzalo Queseda (6).</p>
